{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307120/extras/c222c02bc6d0bae4a62d79b12cdef31f.avif?t=1773823977\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It's time to make love happen, again!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step back into the role of trainee matchmaker, and help quirky clients find their perfect match, all under the 'expert' supervision of British Drag Queen and matchmaking maven, Kitty Powers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you restore her neglected dating agencies to their full potential?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you become a Matchmaking Maestro?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This remastered version has been rebuilt from the ground up and features vibrant new artwork, expanded customization options, and a host of gameplay improvements to make matchmaking even more fun and inclusive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307120/extras/170fece8601ddef66c0f02aefbcf1d09.avif?t=1773823977\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhanced Artwork:</strong> Feast your eyes on Matchmaker\u2019s enhanced assets and sumptuously high definition artwork.\u00a0Now with 4K and ultra-widescreen modes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >N<strong>ew and Improved Mini-games:</strong> Tackle four brand new dating dilemmas including \u2018Fling the Food\u2019, \u2018Rose or Knickers\u2019 and \u2018Divide the Dessert\u2019, as well as numerous improved minigames from the original!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New and Expanded Game Mechanics:</strong> Get to grips with new mechanics such as \u2018Chemistry\u2019 and \u2018Juicy Secrets\u2019 to take your matchmaking to new heights!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanded Customization:</strong> Players have new options to dress and style their characters, with updated personalities and fashion that ensures anything goes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More Diversity:</strong> Choose from male, female and non-binary characters, who can be straight, gay, bisexual or pansexual!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Salon Makeover:</strong> Meet your new personal stylist, who will help you spruce up your characters up for their big night with upgradeable salon treatments!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Return of Kitty Powers:</strong> The iconic drag queen is back with her signature witty commentary, guiding players on their matchmaking journey! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"At Least See The Menu","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3307120/56d8c5fc3ac9cfa8a70a9d8f2e9c8ba357d23d5e.jpg"},{"name":"Chemical Reaction","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3307120/abe49aa18e7462daf1c273b9dfa2f7eee2fd0d90.jpg"},{"name":"Test Tube Baby","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3307120/45cd1ed554d8d5409d96d90402429dfb61df4b37.jpg"},{"name":"Lucky Guesser","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3307120/f0a9feb96ea7e2c0224339728a090a936d411e8c.jpg"},{"name":"The Full Monty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3307120/9c0fb1d2888f37452c2133ba29689228a71de33f.jpg"},{"name":"Deep Probing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3307120/ea097dfd962a39aa36a61b83a06bc9e3d8b27ad2.jpg"},{"name":"Max Makeover","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3307120/de702037118a903f4fe23ca662cdf9d47c4ea927.jpg"},{"name"