 iconic drag queen is back with her signature witty commentary, guiding players on their matchmaking journey! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Magic Notion Ltd"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307120/19458048fd3cdf9d739a676eb1cd5c307cf91f97/header.jpg?t=1773823977","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright 2026 Magic Notion. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Big Sur 11.0+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon or x64 architecture with SSE2<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Metal capable GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3307120/696624361/89b501898a448d0bc6b1906fcf0da0692e647387/1770897735/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770898192","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3307120/696624361/89b501898a448d0bc6b1906fcf0da0692e647387/1770897735/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770898192","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3307120/696624361/89b501898a448d0bc6b1906fcf0da0692e647387/1770897735/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770898192","id":257285523,"name":"Kitty Powers Matchmaker Makeover Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257285523/8f57a90fb7e8a9589cdca9e21b2b76393dbad9ef/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1770898192"}],"